<title>USA: U.S. Jan personal income rose 0.3 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. Jan personal income rose 0.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department personal income and spending estimates, in seasonally adjusted annual rates.</p>
<p>    Percent Changes:    Jan    Dec--(Prev)   Nov--(Prev)   Oct</p>
<p> Income (Current Dlrs)  0.3    0.7    0.8    0.6    0.6    0.1</p>
<p>Disposable Income:</p>
<p> -- Current Dlrs	  0.6    0.7    0.8    0.6    0.6    0.1</p>
<p> -- Chain '92 Dlrs	0.5    0.5    0.6    0.4    0.4   -0.2</p>
<p>Consumption:</p>
<p> -- Current Dlrs	  0.7    0.2    0.5    0.5    0.4    0.9</p>
<p> -- Chain '92 Dlrs	0.6   Unch    0.3    0.3    0.2    0.6</p>
<p>    Billions of Dlrs:   Jan    Dec--(Prev)   Nov--(Prev)   Oct</p>
<p> Income		   6,653  6,633  6,639  6,585  6,584  6,544</p>
<p> Disposable Income    5,774  5,737  5,744  5,699  5,698  5,663</p>
<p> Personal Outlays     5,464  5,426  5,434  5,415  5,409  5,387</p>
